                        Charges
                        <i class="mdi mdi-help-circle text-primary ms-2" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="Charges: Define the charge policies for the loan product, including the application of charges, minimum and maximum charge rates, and conditions for charge cessation.
Key Points:
1. Apply Charges: Check this box to apply charges to this loan product.
2. Minimum Charge Rate: Set the minimum charge rate applicable to the loan product.
3. Default Charge Rate: Define the default charge rate applicable to the loan product.
4. Minimum Days to Apply Charges After Due Date: Specify the minimum number of days to apply charges after the loan due date.
5. Maximum Days to Apply Charges After Due Date: Specify the maximum number of days to apply charges after the loan due date.
6. Default Days to Apply Charges After Due Date: Set the default number of days to apply charges after the loan due date.
7. Maximum Charge Rate: Define the maximum charge rate applicable to the loan product.
8. Charges Cessation: Specify the number of days after which charges should stop applying to this product.
9. Charges Applied On: Select whether charges are applied to interest or balance.
"></i>
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapsePaymentMethod1"
                     class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     aria-labelledby="headingPaymentMethod1"
                     data-bs-parent="#collapsibleSection">
